      - They can  make a person hallucinate.
      - It is not deadly so the effect should fade out after a while.
      - 'You shouldn''t be roaming this forest if you''re not an adventurer. '
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: Adventurer
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Is this also an hallucination?
      - Is this really a dream? I feel dizzy...
      triggerDistortion: 1
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: Adventurer
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Hey!!
      - Don't pass out on me.
      triggerDistortion: 1
    showChoiceScreen: 0
    choicePrompt: What would you like to do?
    choiceLabelA: Head Out
    choiceLabelB: Stay and Explore
    choiceTeleport: {fileID: 0}
  - objectiveName: Take the health potion
    type: 5
    skipObjective: 1
    arrowTarget: {fileID: 1382143533}
    arrowTargets: []
    door: {fileID: 0}
    triggerPoints:
    - {fileID: 968989752}
    targetEnemies: []
    targetSkeletons: []
    potion: {fileID: 1382143534}
    showNameScreenAfterComplete: 1
    pointsReward: 5
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    questTeleport: {fileID: 0}
    startSequence:
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: Adventurer
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - How are you feeling?
      - The smoke made you pass out so i brought you here.
      - There is a health potion on the table. You should take it, it will make you
        feel better.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    completionSequence:
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Feeling better?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Yes, i feel much better. Thank you.
      - Where exactly am i?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - We are in east side of alder town.
      - 'You should know you will be fined for wondering the Hollow Woods alone. '
      - Even adventurers are scared of that place.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - alder town? Hollow woods? What is this world?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - This world? you act as if you came from outspace.
      - Wait don't tell me the smoke made you lose your memories.
      - If the smoke had such dire effects on you then you must be an F rank adventurer
        at best.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - (I think it will be best to play along.. i don't think she knows anything
        about where i came from.)
      - ...
      - Yes.. i don't really remember anything.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Well do you atleast remember your name?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - ... no.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Well ill give you a temporary one until you remember your name.
      - What about blue? becuase you appeared out of the blue. haha
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - You are not very good at naming are you.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    showChoiceScreen: 0
    choicePrompt: What would you like to do?
    choiceLabelA: Head Out
    choiceLabelB: Stay and Explore
    choiceTeleport: {fileID: 0}
  - objectiveName: talk to skye
    type: 2
    skipObjective: 1
    arrowTarget: {fileID: 1357781050}
    arrowTargets: []
    door: {fileID: 0}
    triggerPoints:
    - {fileID: 968989752}
    targetEnemies: []
    targetSkeletons: []
    potion: {fileID: 0}
    showNameScreenAfterComplete: 0
    pointsReward: 5
    cutscene: {fileID: 0}
    questTeleport: {fileID: 0}
    startSequence:
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: Adventurer
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - I think i will stick with {name} for now.
      - I still don't know your name.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: Adventurer
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - That should work until you remember your real name.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: Skye
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Late introduction but my name is Skye. I am a B class adventurer.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: Skye
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - and what exactly is an adventurer?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: Skye
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - An adventurer is someone who takes commisions from the guild.
      - Why don't you join me for a commision. I'll also show you around. Maybe that
        will jog your memories.
      - and since i'm an B rank adventurer, rest assured I won't let anything harm
        you.
      - Let me know when you are ready to head out.
      triggerDistortion: 0
    completionSequence:
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: SKye
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - So are you ready to head out?
      triggerDistortion: 0
    showChoiceScreen: 1
    choicePrompt: Head out?
    choiceLabelA: Head Out
    choiceLabelB: Stay and Explore
    choiceTeleport: {fileID: 1533161311}
