      triggerDistortion: 0
    completionSequence:
    - speaker: 1
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - Good job, so you do know how to fight.
      - These monsters don't usually appear in a low level dungeon. This is strange.
      - 'Lets quickly complete this mission and head home. '
      triggerDistortion: 0
    - speaker: 0
      npcName: 
      npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd544c963961fc47b5d47d174ba9bef, type: 3}
      lines:
      - I am also suprised. i thought i was hallucinating about these powers before..
      triggerDistortion: 0
